I"Y"<h1 id="vs-code-shortcut-cheat-sheet">VS Code Shortcut Cheat Sheet</h1>

<p>Shortcuts below use Windows/Linux and macOS key names. On macOS, <code class="language-plaintext highlighter-rouge">Cmd</code> is Command and <code class="language-plaintext highlighter-rouge">Option</code> is Alt. Keybindings can change with keyboard layout, extensions, and user settings.</p>

