<h2 id="useful-settings">Useful settings</h2>

<p>Add settings through the Settings editor or <code class="language-plaintext highlighter-rouge">settings.json</code>. These examples enable format-on-save and trim trailing whitespace:</p>

<div class="language-json highlighter-rouge"><div class="highlight"><pre class="highlight"><code><span class="p">{</span><span class="w">
	</span><span class="nl">"editor.formatOnSave"</span><span class="p">:</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="kc">true</span><span class="p">,</span><span class="w">
	</span><span class="nl">"files.trimTrailingWhitespace"</span><span class="p">:</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="kc">true</span><span class="w">
</span><span class="p">}</span><span class="w">
</span></code></pre></div></div>

<h2 id="find-or-troubleshoot-a-shortcut">Find or troubleshoot a shortcut</h2>

<ol>
  <li>Open Keyboard Shortcuts with <code class="language-plaintext highlighter-rouge">Ctrl+K Ctrl+S</code> or <code class="language-plaintext highlighter-rouge">Cmd+K Cmd+S</code>.</li>
  <li>Search by command name or key combination. Right-click a command to configure or remove its binding.</li>
  <li>If a key is intercepted or behaves unexpectedly, run <strong>Developer: Toggle Keyboard Shortcuts Troubleshooting</strong> from the Command Palette and inspect the Output panel.</li>
</ol>

